{
 "_comment": [
  "Measured agent token volumes per task family and model family, from Exgentic/agent-llm-traces-v2 (Hugging Face):",
  "10,057 complete agent sessions (241,674 chat spans) across five harnesses (claude_code, openai_solo, smolagents_code,",
  "tool_calling, tool_calling_with_shortlisting) and six benchmarks (AppWorld personal-assistant API tasks, BrowseComp-Plus",
  "deep research, SWE-bench software engineering, tau2-bench airline/retail/telecom customer service), run in April-May 2026",
  "on five models: claude-opus-4-5, gpt-5.2-2025-12-11, DeepSeek-V3.2, Kimi-K2.5, gemini-3-pro-preview. OpenTelemetry",
  "GenAI spans carry gen_ai.usage.input_tokens / output_tokens per LLM call.",
  "rows: one line per (benchmark, subset, harness, model) as aggregated with DuckDB over the parquet shards:",
  "  n_runs, mean score, success rate, steps, LLM calls (spans) per run, mean input tokens per run (sum over calls, as reported",
  "  by the provider), mean output tokens per run, mean 'new' input per run (input_t - input_{t-1} - output_{t-1} within a",
  "  conversation: the part a prefix cache cannot serve), mean max context, the dataset's reported agent cost, seconds.",
  "agg: per task family (tau2 = airline+retail+telecom) and model family (anthropic/openai/deepseek/kimi/google): run-weighted",
  "  MEDIANS across harness rows (robust to one harness with anomalous accounting), success and score run-weighted means.",
  "  in_tok uses only rows whose input accounting looks like totals (>= 2,000 input tokens per call): Anthropic and Gemini",
  "  rows in some harnesses report uncached input only. cached_share = 1 - new input / input.",
  "CAVEATS stated on the page: reasoning/thinking tokens may or may not be inside output_tokens depending on provider and",
  "harness (OpenAI and Anthropic outputs look low next to DeepSeek/Kimi/Gemini); success semantics are each benchmark's own;",
  "these are 2025-26 models standing in for the current baskets by lab family. The dataset page states no license.",
  "Refresh: rerun the DuckDB aggregation (engine/collect_traces.py documents the query) when the dataset is updated; it is",
  "not fetched daily."
 ],
